WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:01.903
- But I noticed you have a tattoo.

00:00:03.787 --> 00:00:05.450
I have 17. (laughs)

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:06.800
- I don't have tattoos,
I have stretch marks.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:07.750
- I have those too.

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:11.160
- Depending on how I move,
I can change the figure.

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:11.993
- Very cool.

00:00:11.993 --> 00:00:13.930
- The characters look
different when I shift.

00:00:15.152 --> 00:00:17.260
- I have a couple tattoos
that are super suspect

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:18.093
at this point.

00:00:18.093 --> 00:00:18.926
- Right.

00:00:18.926 --> 00:00:19.759
- [Kelly] They look different.

00:00:19.759 --> 00:00:21.052
- Well, what about that guy?

00:00:21.052 --> 00:00:21.932
Funky.

00:00:21.932 --> 00:00:23.252
- [Kelly] Yeah. He's
getting my name tattooed.

00:00:23.252 --> 00:00:24.085
- I know.

00:00:24.085 --> 00:00:24.918
- [Kelly] He's gonna regret it.

00:00:24.918 --> 00:00:25.751
But what's yours?

00:00:25.751 --> 00:00:26.690
What does your tattoo mean?

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:28.680
- Don't you think it's rude
that he has so many tattoos

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:32.330
and he didn't ask you of
us, for our autographs?

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:34.770
- Like really, please can we bring that up

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:35.882
when he comes back?
- Yes

00:00:35.882 --> 00:00:39.790
- He actually, he recognized
me but he confused me

00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:40.932
for being someone else.

00:00:40.932 --> 00:00:41.765
- No

00:00:41.765 --> 00:00:42.690
- Sign that person's name.

00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:44.340
- That happens to me all
the time, you'd think..

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:46.503
Seriously, I've been asked so many times

00:00:46.503 --> 00:00:50.160
or they'll be like, Oh my gosh
I love your song, So Small.

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:52.040
And I'm like, I don't
even know that that is.

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:52.873
- What is that?

00:00:52.873 --> 00:00:54.370
- And then I find out,
it's Carrie Underwood

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:58.154
and I'm like, and then
I'm like, thank you.

00:00:58.154 --> 00:01:00.482
(crowd applauds)

00:01:00.482 --> 00:01:03.815
- Cause I'm like legit a 100 lbs heavier

00:01:03.815 --> 00:01:05.940
than Carrie Underwood.

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:08.670
So I was like that can be
lot, yeah I'm just saying

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:10.137
it's real different though.

